          <p class="text-[1rem] leading-[1.65] text-charcoal/70 max-w-[40ch]">
            Most builds ship in one to three weeks. Fastest so far: <em class="not-italic font-medium text-charcoal">Elevated Water Solutions in seven days</em>, idea to production. Written timeline before any code is written.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article>
          <div class="border-t border-charcoal/20 pt-6 mb-6">
            <span class="numeral text-saffron-deep text-[3rem] leading-none">0</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-serif font-semibold text-[1.5rem] leading-[1.2] tracking-[-0.012em] text-charcoal mb-4 max-w-[18ch]">
            Lock-in. You own it.
          </h3>
          <p class="text-[1rem] leading-[1.65] text-charcoal/70 max-w-[40ch]">
            Code in a GitHub repo you own. Domain in your name. Hosting under your Vercel account. If we ever part ways, you walk away with everything &mdash; no ransom.
          </p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

